    "innovation": "This paper develops synthetic, observationally-constrained climate projections to show that standard models significantly underestimate future uncertainty in Northern Hemisphere temperature, precipitation, and the occurrence of extreme seasons by failing to capture the full range of large-scale atmospheric circulation variability.",
